    ["<Assistant_Title1>【终末猎杀】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>终末猎杀</>是发生在<Assistant_Property1>猎龙之城</>的野外<Assistant_Red>500人混战</>玩法。你可以击败超凡生物或敌对玩家，获得<Assistant_Property1>猩红遗物材料</>与段位胜点。\n<Assistant_Title2>核心目标：</>将<Assistant_Property1>猩红遗物材料</>提交给<Assistant_System>猎杀管家</>，推进猎杀进度并解锁阶段奖励。猩红遗物仅在猎龙之城内有效，离开后将自动失效并清除。\n<Assistant_Title2>猎杀时刻：</>玩法全天开放；每日<Assistant_Red>19:00—20:00</>为猎杀时刻，周六、周日额外开放<Assistant_Red>14:00—15:00</>。猎杀时刻期间，击杀或被击杀时涉及的段位胜点数量翻倍。\n<Assistant_Title2>王城事件：</>每周五、周日晚的猎杀时刻开启10分钟后，即<Assistant_Red>19:10</>，王城中心刷新巨龙·投影；除周五、周日晚场外，其他猎杀时刻开始10分钟后刷新王城守卫者。\n<Assistant_Title2>团队结算：</>击杀者及最多29名符合助攻条件的同团队成员参与奖励结算。猩红遗物按参与人数平均分配，余数优先分配给击杀者1个，其余在其他参与者中随机分配。\n<Assistant_Title2>掠夺规则：</>玩家头顶显示的碎片数量越多，抢夺猩红遗物的比例越高；头顶碎片数每提高500个，抢夺比例相应提升。\n<Assistant_Title2>段位规则：</>段位低于<Assistant_Red>伯爵1阶</>时，被击杀不会损失段位胜点。每日01:00—08:00及短时间内重复击杀同一目标时，击杀玩家获得的段位胜点将按规则衰减。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往终末猎杀]|1250342}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Final Hunt】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</><Assistant_System>Final Hunt</> is a 500-player open-field <Assistant_Red>battle royale</> mode that takes place in the <Assistant_Property1>City of Dragon Hunting</>. You can defeat Beyonder creatures or hostile players to obtain <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> and Rank Points.\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective:</> Submit <Assistant_Property1>Scarlet Relic Materials</> to the <Assistant_System>Hunting Butler</> to advance the hunting progress and unlock stage rewards. Scarlet Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting; they will automatically expire and be cleared upon leaving.\n<Assistant_Title2>Hunting Time:</> The mode is available all day; <Assistant_Red>19:00—20:00</> daily is Hunting Time, with an additional session on Saturdays and Sundays from <Assistant_Red>14:00—15:00</>. During Hunting Time, the number of Rank Points involved in kills or deaths is doubled.\n<Assistant_Title2>Royal City Event:</> 10 minutes after the start of the Hunting Time on Friday and Sunday nights, i.e., at <Assistant_Red>19:10</>, a Dragon - Projection will spawn in the center of the Royal City; outside of the Friday and Sunday night sessions, a Royal City Guardian will spawn 10 minutes after the start of other Hunting Times.\n<Assistant_Title2>Team Settlement:</> The killer and up to 29 eligible team members who contributed assists participate in the reward settlement. Scarlet Relics are distributed equally among participants, with any remainder given first to the killer, and the rest distributed randomly among other participants.\n<Assistant_Title2>Plunder Rules:</> The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the percentage of Scarlet Relics that can be plundered; for every 500 additional fragments, the plunder percentage increases accordingly.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rank Rules:</> When your rank is below <Assistant_Red>Earl Tier 1</>, you will not lose Rank Points upon being killed. Rank Points gained from killing players will decay according to the rules between 01:00—08:00 daily and when killing the same target repeatedly within a short period.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to Final Hunt]|1250342}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>灾祸平息</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-城市暗面\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成“天灾之门”事件"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Calamity Subsided</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>TRPG-Dark Side of the City\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the \"Gate of Calamity\" event",
    ["<P_Heart>（希望附近的墙里不要再出现一个破洞的屁股……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I hope another butt with a hole in it doesn't appear in the nearby wall...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（竟然愣住了）</>……抱歉，我从未想过。"] = "<P_Heart> (Actually stunned) </> ...Sorry, I never thought of that.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>友敌关系</>\n相同队伍、团队或俱乐部的成员视为友方，<Highlight>其余玩家均为敌对关系</>，可自由攻击。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>团队结算</>\n击败敌对玩家时，击杀者及最多<Highlight>29名</>符合助攻条件的同团队成员参与本次猩红遗物与段位胜点结算。\n本次可分配的猩红遗物按参与人数平均分配并向下取整。存在余数时，击杀者优先额外获得1个，其余部分在其他参与者中随机分配，每人最多额外获得1个。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>掠夺规则</>\n击败敌对玩家后，可从目标处掠夺<Highlight>段位胜点</>与其持有的<Highlight>猩红遗物</>。玩家头顶显示的碎片数量越多，抢夺猩红遗物的比例越高；头顶碎片数每提高<Highlight>500个</>，抢夺比例相应提升。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位保护</>\n段位低于<Highlight>伯爵1阶</>的玩家，被击杀时不扣除段位胜点。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位胜点衰减</>\n每日<Highlight>01:00—08:00</>，击杀玩家获得的段位胜点调整为正常值的<Highlight>10%</>，猎杀进度提供的段位胜点不受影响。\n同一玩家在10分钟内重复击杀同一目标时，第1—3次获得100%段位胜点，第4次获得50%，第5次获得20%，第6次及以后不再获得。两项衰减规则同时生效时，最终结果按比例乘算。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Friend/Enemy Relationship </> \n Members of the same team, group, or Club are considered allies; <Highlight> all other players are hostile </> and can be attacked freely. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Team Settlement </> \n When defeating a hostile player, the killer and up to <Highlight> 29 </> team members who meet the assist criteria participate in this Crimson Relic and Rank Point settlement. \n The distributable Crimson Relics are divided equally among the participants and rounded down. If there is a remainder, the killer gets priority for 1 extra, and the rest are distributed randomly among other participants, with each person receiving at most 1 extra. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Plunder Rules </> \n After defeating a hostile player, you can plunder <Highlight> Rank Points </> and the <Highlight> Crimson Relics </> they hold from the target. The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the percentage of Crimson Relics that can be plundered; for every <Highlight> 500 </> fragments above the head, the plunder percentage increases accordingly. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rank Protection </> \n Players with a rank lower than <Highlight> Earl Tier 1 </> will not lose Rank Points when killed. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rank Point Decay </> \n Daily <Highlight> 01:00—08:00 </>, Rank Points obtained from killing players are adjusted to <Highlight> 10% </> of the normal value; Rank Points provided by hunting progress are not affected. \n When the same player kills the same target repeatedly within 10 minutes, the 1st—3rd times grant 100% Rank Points, the 4th time grants 50%, the 5th time grants 20%, and the 6th time and onwards grant none. When both decay rules are in effect simultaneously, the final result is calculated by multiplying the proportions.",
